  "2026-11-28T02:12:28.420Z",codex-agent,Verified the release wrapper forces stdout and decides by comparing the entire file. Keep its full-release argument guard and use the published CLI for generation and check results.
  "2026-11-28T02:20:01.919Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert kept the new dependency and tests but restored the original wrapper. The pending-only default check returned 1 where the test required 0. After restoration the linked wrapper suite passed all 17 tests, including read-only pending acceptance, strict pending rejection and versioned drift rejection."
  "2026-11-28T02:20:05.013Z",codex-agent,"Typecheck, test typecheck, docstrings and lint passed. Regenerate and check the changelog after releasing this claim. Exact-head CI is tracked at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack/actions?query=branch%3Afix%2Fchangelog-wrapper-pending-check."
